; Five ruins of the same panelled alien technology, broken into differently
; stretched and buried fragments. Four centres are dry sites spread around the
; globe; the fifth follows PlanetShape's north and accepts only its pack ice.
; Each field is one MultiMesh and therefore one draw call. Nearby collision is a
; simplified copy of the visible core/panels, clipped at the burial plane and
; streamed out again away from players; empty outer-envelope air stays empty.
[node name="TechFormationSites" type="Node3D" parent="Planet"]
script = ExtResource("33_tech_sites")

; Four marked fields of partially buried green crystal rings: circles, tall
; ovals and low elongated arches. The arctic field's 720 m hero ring sits on a
; surveyed pack-ice footprint 2.5 km from the pole, leaving 1.39 km of open ice
; beyond the north tech field's outer bound. All four fields were also excluded
; from the giant summits. Each site is one MultiMesh; accurate convex segment
; collision streams only around players, while local green lights illuminate
; nearby ground in daylight and darkness.
[node name="RingSites" type="Node3D" parent="Planet"]
script = ExtResource("36_ring_sites")

; The four tallest distinct summits in the current height field, refined to the
