; A third moving variant: sparse low-poly shoals whose own colours wake into
; asynchronous blue bioluminescence at night. It reuses the reef VAT topology,
; but whole schools hold deeper water and move on wider, faster circuits. One
; pose upload per frame is the hard CPU cap.
;
; Deliberately left thin. Twenty-four schools over this ring is the density the
; open water had before, and a night ocean reads better for having to be looked
; for than the reef does.
